    "Id": "chassisdef_roncone_RNC-X1",
    "Name": "Roncone",
    "Details": "The X1 was the original Roncone prototype version, carrying a similar, although upgraded, weapon loadout to the Battlemaster BLR-4L. Two ER PPC, two MML-9 launchers and a Gauss Rifle makes sure the 'Mech can engage from a distance before it is fully detected.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Combat Computer</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.29</color></b>",
